B.a1p=s(["Spray Propiconazole 25% EC @ 1 ml/liter of water at first symptom","Spray Tebiconazole 250 EC @ 1 ml/liter if infection is severe","Apply NPK balanced fertilizer (avoid excessive Nitrogen)","Consult nearest Krishi Vigyan Kendra (KVK) for localized spray advice"],t.s)
B.Xn=s(["Plant rust-resistant varieties like HD 2967, DBW 187, or PBW 725","Sow early in November to avoid late-season rust build-up","Maintain proper crop field sanitation and weed control"],t.s)
