B.YH=s(["Spray Copper Oxychloride 50% WP @ 2.5 g + Streptocycline @ 0.1 g per liter","Remove severely infected lower leaves and bolls from field"],t.s)
B.a3u=s(["Delint cotton seed with concentrated sulfuric acid","Soak seeds in Streptocycline solution (100 ppm) for 2 hours before sowing","Maintain crop rotation with non-host crops like Maize or Sorghum"],t.s)
